{"id": "2fad945d-b19d-496a-9a98-d3c577e36c32", "slug": "initialize-account-1", "title": "Initialize Account", "description": "Initialize Account Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Initialize Account\"\ndescription: \"Initialize Account Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EA580C\"\n  secondary: \"#FDFBF9\"\n  accent: \"#C2410C\"\n  background: \"#FDFBF9\"\n  surface: \"#F0EBE1\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#292524\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Initialize Account\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 2; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, security, input, validation, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nInitialize Account Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nHorizon Step 01 Establish your Horizon workspace Account classification Individual access Corporate email Mobile number Required for two-factor authentication Account password Initialize Workspace By continuing, you acc…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Establish your Horizon workspace; Distribute intelligent corporate cards.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EA580C, secondary #FDFBF9, accent #C2410C, background #FDFBF9, surface #F0EBE1, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Initialize Account</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#FDFBF9] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-gray-900 antialiased\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #FFF7ED 0%, #FDFBF9 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Premium Container with Border Gradient, Remixed to flex-row (Left to Right) -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1120px] bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(234,88,12,0.08),0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] flex flex-col md:flex-row overflow-visible relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(white, white) padding-box, linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(234,88,12,0.2) 0%, rgba(200,200,200,0.1) 100%) border-box;\">\n\n        <!-- Left Panel: Form (Remixed from Right to Left) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-[48%] p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 bg-white rounded-t-3xl md:rounded-tr-none md:rounded-l-3xl\">\n\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-10 md:mb-14\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-[#ea580c] text-2xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"font-normal text-lg tracking-tight text-gray-800\">Horizon</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-md w-full mx-auto md:mx-0\">\n                <!-- User requested: put step 01 instead -->\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-[#ea580c] mb-3 tracking-wide uppercase\">Step 01</div>\n\n                <!-- User requested: fix heading -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-tight mb-8 masked-reveal text-gray-900\">\n                    Establish your <br> Horizon workspace\n                </h1>\n\n                <form class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Custom Select -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-600\">Account classification</label>\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-center w-full p-3.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-[#FDFBF9] cursor-pointer hover:border-[#ea580c]/40 hover:bg-orange-50/30 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-gray-500 mr-3 text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"flex-grow text-sm font-normal text-gray-800\">Individual access</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Email -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-600\">Corporate email</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"jane.doe@company.com\" class=\"w-full p-3.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm outline-none focus:border-[#ea580c] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#ea580c] transition-all bg-[#FDFBF9] placeholder-gray-400 font-normal\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Phone -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-600\">Mobile number</label>\n                        <input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+1 (555) 000-0000\" class=\"w-full p-3.5 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm outline-none focus:border-[#ea580c] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#ea580c] transition-all bg-[#FDFBF9] placeholder-gray-400 font-normal\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1\">Required for two-factor authentication</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Password -->\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-600\">Account password</label>\n                        <div class=\"relative\">\n                            <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" class=\"w-full p-3.5 pr-10 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm outline-none focus:border-[#ea580c] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#ea580c] transition-all bg-[#FDFBF9] placeholder-gray-400 font-normal\">\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute right-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-gray-400 hover:text-[#ea580c] transition-colors\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Submit -->\n                    <div class=\"pt-4\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full bg-[#ea580c] shadow-[0_10px_20px_-10px_rgba(234,88,12,0.5)] text-white text-sm font-normal rounded-xl py-4 hover:bg-[#c2410c] hover:shadow-[0_15px_25px_-10px_rgba(234,88,12,0.6)] transition-all relative overflow-hidden group\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10\">Initialize Workspace</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Terms -->\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-center text-gray-400 mt-4 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                        By continuing, you accept our <br>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#ea580c] hover:underline\">Terms of Service</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#ea580c] hover:underline\">Privacy Policy</a>\n                    </p>\n                </form>\n\n                <!-- Divider -->\n                <div class=\"relative my-6 flex items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-100\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"flex-shrink-0 mx-4 text-xs text-gray-400 bg-white px-2 font-normal\">Already have an account?</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-100\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Button -->\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full border border-gray-200 text-[#ea580c] text-sm font-normal rounded-xl py-3.5 hover:bg-orange-50/50 hover:border-orange-200 transition-colors\">\n                    Sign In\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Panel: Feature & WebGL (Remixed from Left to Right) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-[52%] p-3 md:p-6 flex overflow-visible\">\n            <!-- Inner container with beautiful warm gradient -->\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-2xl flex flex-col p-8 md:p-12 relative overflow-visible shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(234,88,12,0.03)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FAF8F5 0%, #F0EBE1 100%);\">\n\n                <!-- Progress Indicators -->\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-10 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"h-0.5 w-6 bg-[#ea580c] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(234,88,12,0.4)] rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"h-0.5 w-6 bg-gray-300 rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Text Content -->\n                <div class=\"mb-8 z-10 relative\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight mb-3 masked-reveal text-gray-900\">Distribute intelligent corporate cards</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-sm masked-reveal font-normal\">\n                        Equip your workforce with beautifully crafted physical and virtual cards. Set smart spending controls and monitor all transactions instantly.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- WebGL & UI Overlay Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative flex-grow w-full min-h-[350px] mt-4 z-0 rounded-xl overflow-visible flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                    <!-- Ambient Glow behind WebGL -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#ea580c]/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl scale-150 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Three.js Canvas Container -->\n                    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-[-10%] w-[120%] h-[120%]\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating UI Elements with Beautiful Shadows & Gradients -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between overflow-visible\">\n\n                        <!-- Top Left Icon -->\n                        <div class=\"ui-float-element bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(234,88,12,0.15)] self-start -ml-2 md:-ml-6 -mt-2\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; background-clip: padding-box; background-image: linear-gradient(white, white); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(234,88,12,0.15);\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-send-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-[#ea580c]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bottom Right Balance -->\n                        <div class=\"ui-float-element bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_25px_50px_-12px_rgba(234,88,12,0.2)] self-end -mr-2 md:-mr-6 -mb-4 w-48\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; background-clip: padding-box; background-image: linear-gradient(white, white); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(234,88,12,0.2);\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-500\">Available liquidity</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-linear\" class=\"text-[#ea580c]/60 text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900\">$142,850</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Animation ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.masked-reveal').forEach(el => {\n            const text = el.innerText;\n            const words = text.split(' ');\n            el.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wordWrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wordWrapper.style.cssText = 'display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0.25rem; padding-bottom: 0.1rem;';\n\n                const innerWord = document.createElement('span');\n                innerWord.style.cssText = 'display: inline-block; transform: translateY(110%);';\n                innerWord.innerText = word;\n\n                wordWrapper.appendChild(innerWord);\n                el.appendChild(wordWrapper);\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('span > span'), {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.85,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: 'top 95%'\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // UI Elements Float Animation\n        const floatElements = document.querySelectorAll('.ui-float-element');\n        if(floatElements.length > 0) {\n            gsap.to(floatElements[0], { y: -15, duration: 2.8, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: 'sine.inOut' });\n        }\n        if(floatElements.length > 1) {\n            gsap.to(floatElements[1], { y: 12, duration: 3.2, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: 'sine.inOut', delay: 0.6 });\n        }\n\n\n        // --- Three.js WebGL Setup (Highly Detailed & Rounded Cards) ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n        if (container && window.THREE) {\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Lighting for Beautiful Dimensional Shadows\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.8);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffeddb, 1.4);\n            dirLight.position.set(5, 10, 8);\n            scene.add(dirLight);\n\n            const backLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 0.5);\n            backLight.position.set(-5, -5, -5);\n            scene.add(backLight);\n\n            // --- User Requested: Cards should be rounded ---\n            // Create a custom rounded rectangle geometry instead of BoxGeometry\n            const cardWidth = 3.4;\n            const cardHeight = 2.1;\n            const cardRadius = 0.15;\n\n            const shape = new THREE.Shape();\n            const x = -cardWidth / 2;\n            const y = -cardHeight / 2;\n\n            shape.moveTo(x, y + cardRadius);\n            shape.lineTo(x, y + cardHeight - cardRadius);\n            shape.quadraticCurveTo(x, y + cardHeight, x + cardRadius, y + cardHeight);\n            shape.lineTo(x + cardWidth - cardRadius, y + cardHeight);\n            shape.quadraticCurveTo(x + cardWidth, y + cardHeight, x + cardWidth, y + cardHeight - cardRadius);\n            shape.lineTo(x + cardWidth, y + cardRadius);\n            shape.quadraticCurveTo(x + cardWidth, y, x + cardWidth - cardRadius, y);\n            shape.lineTo(x + cardRadius, y);\n            shape.quadraticCurveTo(x, y, x, y + cardRadius);\n\n            const extrudeSettings = {\n                depth: 0.02,\n                bevelEnabled: true,\n                bevelSegments: 3,\n                steps: 1,\n                bevelSize: 0.015,\n                bevelThickness: 0.015\n            };\n\n            const cardGeometry = new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape, extrudeSettings);\n\n            // Fix UV Mapping for ExtrudeGeometry so textures apply correctly to front/back faces\n            const posAttribute = cardGeometry.attributes.position;\n            const uvAttribute = cardGeometry.attributes.uv;\n            for (let i = 0; i < posAttribute.count; i++) {\n                const px = posAttribute.getX(i);\n                const py = posAttribute.getY(i);\n                // Planar mapping normalized to 0-1 range\n                const u = (px + cardWidth / 2) / cardWidth;\n                const v = (py + cardHeight / 2) / cardHeight;\n                uvAttribute.setXY(i, u, v);\n            }\n            cardGeometry.attributes.uv.needsUpdate = true;\n            cardGeometry.computeVertexNormals();\n\n            // Create highly detailed texture canvas\n            const createDetailedCardTexture = (bgColor, textColor, logoText) => {\n                const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n                canvas.width = 1024; canvas.height = 640;\n                const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n                // Base background\n                ctx.fillStyle = bgColor;\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 1024, 640);\n\n                // Subtle overlay gradient for depth\n                const grd = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 1024, 640);\n                grd.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.15)');\n                grd.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0.15)');\n                ctx.fillStyle = grd;\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 1024, 640);\n\n                // Smart Chip\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#E6C687'; // Metallic gold/beige\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.roundRect(100, 260, 110, 85, 12);\n                ctx.fill();\n                // Chip lines\n                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.15)';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(100, 302); ctx.lineTo(135, 302); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(175, 302); ctx.lineTo(210, 302); ctx.stroke();\n\n                // Contactless Icon\n                ctx.strokeStyle = textColor;\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.7;\n                ctx.lineWidth = 5;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(260, 302, 12, -Math.PI/4, Math.PI/4); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(260, 302, 24, -Math.PI/4, Math.PI/4); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(260, 302, 36, -Math.PI/4, Math.PI/4); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;\n\n                // Logo Text\n                ctx.fillStyle = textColor;\n                ctx.font = 'bold 54px Arial';\n                ctx.fillText(logoText, 780, 120);\n\n                // Card Number\n                ctx.font = '500 48px \"Courier New\", monospace';\n                ctx.fillText('****  ****  ****  4281', 100, 460);\n\n                // Validity & Name\n                ctx.font = '24px Arial';\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.6;\n                ctx.fillText('VALID THRU', 100, 510);\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;\n                ctx.font = '32px Arial';\n                ctx.fillText('12/28', 100, 550);\n                ctx.font = '36px Arial';\n                ctx.fillText('JANE DOE', 100, 600);\n\n                // Brand Circles\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.8;\n                ctx.fillStyle = textColor;\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(860, 560, 45, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.5;\n                ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(920, 560, 45, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n                ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;\n\n                const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\n                tex.anisotropy = renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy();\n                return tex;\n            };\n\n            // Deep Charoal/Beige and Vibrant Orange detailed textures\n            const charcoalTex = createDetailedCardTexture('#292524', '#F5F5F5', 'Horizon');\n            const orangeTex = createDetailedCardTexture('#ea580c', '#FFFFFF', 'Horizon');\n\n            const matCharcoal = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0xffffff, map: charcoalTex, roughness: 0.2, metalness: 0.3\n            });\n            const matOrange = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0xffffff, map: orangeTex, roughness: 0.25, metalness: 0.1\n            });\n\n            // Card Meshes\n            const cardBack = new THREE.Mesh(cardGeometry, matCharcoal);\n            const cardFront = new THREE.Mesh(cardGeometry, matOrange);\n\n            // Adjusted Positioning to stay well within view (no cropping)\n            cardBack.position.set(0.7, 0.5, -1.5);\n            cardBack.rotation.set(-0.15, 0.2, 0.1);\n\n            cardFront.position.set(-0.3, -0.3, 0);\n            cardFront.rotation.set(-0.2, 0.25, 0.2);\n\n            scene.add(cardBack);\n            scene.add(cardFront);\n\n            camera.position.z = 9.5; // Pulled back for breathing room\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const t = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Smoother, enhanced floating for detailed cards\n                cardFront.position.y = -0.3 + Math.sin(t * 1.1) * 0.1;\n                cardFront.rotation.z = 0.2 + Math.sin(t * 0.7) * 0.03;\n                cardFront.rotation.x = -0.2 + Math.cos(t * 0.5) * 0.02;\n\n                cardBack.position.y = 0.5 + Math.sin(t * 1.3 + 1) * 0.08;\n                cardBack.rotation.x = -0.15 + Math.sin(t * 0.6) * 0.04;\n                cardBack.rotation.y = 0.2 + Math.cos(t * 0.8) * 0.02;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            // Resize Handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                if(container.clientWidth > 0) {\n                    camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                }\n            });\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "initialize-account-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/initialize-account-1.jpg", "source_name": "initialize-account-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 147, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T19:19:23.457045+00:00"}